"note": "pass 87, PRECISE words (the sun head a spiky ball seen from every side, the outfit, her proportions, the catwalk stride, the face turned with the body, never to the camera from the side): her arms-out paintings (front c2, side c2 on words with her face in profile, back c0, edited from SOL-B's) made into a 3D puppet (Hunyuan3D-2mv try 0, Mixamo bones, the shoulders set by hand: the finder had put them on her collar's tips) walking Mixamo's Catwalk Walking; every view on its stick figure (the side on a copy with the far arm hidden while it swings high), the back on its depth video; size from the 3D model (run_fit); colour fringes cleaned. Her side, three-quarter front and three-quarter back painted again (4 candidates each, picked by eye) so her sun face looks where she walks; front, back, cheer and death stay her own paintings (side c2, fd c3, bd c0)",
